<title>NETHERLANDS: Nutricia suspended on Amsterdam bourse.</title>
<headline>Nutricia suspended on Amsterdam bourse.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Amsterdam bourse said on Friday it had suspended trading in shares in food group Nutricia NV until further notice.</p>
<p>The share last traded 16.20 guilders lower at 260.50, hurt by news Britain's Department of Health said it advised shopowners to stop selling its baby milk Milupa Milumil.  </p>
<p>In Britain a spokesman for the Department of Health said the warning followed fears about a possible association between the product and salmonella.</p>
<p>No-one at Nutricia in the Netherlands was immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>--Amsterdam Newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
